> I'd recomend the simple way.  Read a scroll of remove curse.

That's only possible if you've already read the scroll once, because
otherwise "being blind, you cannot read the mystic runes" or something
like that.

If you don't have a scroll, or can't read it:

- dip the blindfold in a fountain
- dip the blindfold in a potion of holy water
- let another nymph steal it (not recommended; you won't have a
blindfold to chase her any more)
- cast a remove curse spell
- pray when you're in good standing with your god and have no other
trouble (a cursed blindfold is minor trouble to gods)
- drop everything you don't want cancelled and zap a wand or spell of
cancellation at yourself (contrary to common belief, this won't do
anything to your intrinsics, just to your inventory).
- (disclaimer: I don't know whether this really works, I just think it
should) polymorph into something without a head

